{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Propagate fatal MDC restoration failures to the invocation caller.** This publishes the previously selected result even when asynchronous `MDC.clear()` or `setContextMap()` throws a direct or wrapped `VirtualMachineError`/`ThreadDeath`. The fatal only escapes the worker, while Lambda may receive `SUCCEEDED` or `PENDING`. Complete `result` exceptionally with the fatal before rethrowing it from the worker, and add an async regression asserting that the caller observes the same fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77P_bx","finding_digest":"a8a5f7ee99e36de816ae84d724372ba5f0fbe07fc30d2240629bc066a8777415","finding_id":"arf_v1_vcs7p3uz4nw6qfvoqtlsinzlux","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::async-mdc-restoration-fatal-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::async-mdc-restoration-fatal-propagation","line":283,"observation_digest":"6f14efea8777a96e243b065cab27c55a1e6a9ede484966606971b48ba8906cc0","observation_id":"aro_v1_n4ko72uho6uw4jb3azokwj6fli","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_vcs7p3uz4nw6qfvoqtlsinzlux","published_at":"2026-10-08T05:43:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ktiyjg3xpxztm6q6rb2bowtsri","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"23abc3875ae661e046a72562efbba4f926a04edb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":281,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_q3zoozgg26ojo6axba54ozl72u","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T05:43:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
